# Active roll control: 3° of fin cant held near zero spin by turning the canards, flown in Simulate with the Roll preset (the
# Control fin cant panel shows the cant the controller holds).
# Run with the example rocket loaded: `cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/roll-control.drive out/roll-control`
viewport 1280x1000
# Select the fin group in the Station Lanes, cant it 3°, switch roll control on.
click (925, 824)
click (1175, 797)
type "3"
type enter
click "Hold a roll rate"
screenshot roll-control-inspector.png
click "Simulate"
click "Run"
click "Roll"
screenshot roll-control-simulate.png
